# Python bytecode caches, at any depth.
__pycache__/
# Virtual environment managed by uv.
.venv/
# Raw evidence archive: large, backed up separately, never committed. Root only: the
# synthetic golden game's archive under tests/fixtures/ is committed on purpose. No trailing
# slash: on the recorder host it is a link to the SSD (deploy/pi-host.md).
/archive
# Secrets must never be committed.
*.pem
.env
# The recorded golden game's expected trace: vendor-derived, written locally by tests/golden.py.
/tests/fixtures/golden/849832/expected.json
# B1 historical reference archive (raw-recorder backfill): vendor data, never committed.
/archive-hist/
# Novig Paper (play-money) test archive: never evidence, never committed.
archive-paper
# The workstation's mirror of the Pi's Paper rehearsal archive (deploy/pi-host.md section 9).
/archive-rehearsal
# B0 feasibility inputs and caches (tools/b0): large, re-fetchable, never committed.
b0-work/
# Harness databases: rebuilt from the archive (clv migrate / clv ingest).
data/
